     SHORT="A simple serial device I/O tool"

cat << EOF
tio is a serial device tool for connecting to TTY devices, such as
microcontroller boards and other serial consoles. It has a straightforward
command-line and text user interface. Features include automatic reconnection,
support for non-standard baud rates, logging, hex and timestamp output modes,
and Lua scripting.
EOF
